  "description": "CSS-first EU energy label nested display as a visual indicator: the class arrow in its regulated colour with the scale range, for every EPREL product group. Zero JavaScript.",
  "type": "module",
  "style": "index.css",
  "scripts": {
    "build:scales": "node scales.build.js"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
